<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Healer Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Healers' guild of Udgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name                   Level   Up to
Cure Light Wounds          0   100%
Cause Light Wounds         1   80%
